1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,800
A PR that bills a cart of three as one.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
You can see the fix. The PR page can't help you write it.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:11,000
So reviewers describe the fix in prose…

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,000
…or hand-build a suggestion block, indentation and all.

5
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,000
Instead: fix it in the file. Your LSP, your formatter, your keys.

6
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:23,000
Then one key turns the edit into the suggestion.

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,500
Posted — and the edit is undone. Your tree matches the PR again.

8
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:29,500
review-mode.nvim
